    "Id": "mechdef_gargoyle_GAR-P",
    "Name": "Gargoyle P",
    "Details": "The Gargoyle P is capable of fighting infantry and armor as well as playing havoc with enemy 'Mechs. Two left arm mounted Plasma Cannons can incinerate enemy infantry with ease and can easily overheat enemy 'Mechs. Two Large Pulse Lasers give the P a strong bite against enemies, but can be lacking compared to other 'Mechs its size. However, if an enemy 'Mech is forced into shutdown the pulse lasers can be used to tear it apart. A center torso Micro Pulse Laser rounds out the weapons complement. Three tons of plasma ammo is stored alongside the cannons in the left arm.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.15</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_gargoyle"
  },
